  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Office of Civil and Criminal Justice Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to ensure equal access to justice in the Commonwealth. To leverage limited resources, this project works in close collaboration with teams across the Secretariat to increase access to justice in areas such as climate change, anti-corruption, and civil procedure law reform. In addition, the Secretariat will scope potential work on military justice reform.???</narrative>
  </description>
